WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.270
- Well, you say the secret
to playing a good villain

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:05.850
is great eye contact, right?

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:06.683
- Mm-hmm.

00:00:06.683 --> 00:00:08.190
- I think you're really good at it

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:09.510
'cause I've seen your stuff,

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:11.010
and I'm like, you're really good at it.

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:14.340
But it's interesting
who sits on this couch,

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:16.461
see, it's terrifying. (laughs)

00:00:16.461 --> 00:00:18.630
(audience laughing)

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:20.640
Wait, like... (laughs)

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:21.720
So that's on "The Mandalorian."

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:24.420
Look at, you just elevator eyed me.

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:27.150
No, no, so wait, so the
funny thing is though

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:28.680
that people sit on this couch,

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:33.030
it's interesting to see the
people that can't do it.

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:35.970
They break eye contact
and I don't know why,

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:36.803
but it's interesting.

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:38.490
I love eye contact.

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:40.710
- You know, the eyes are
the window into the soul.

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:43.560
And sometimes we don't
want people to see us

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:45.540
especially when we're in an awkward

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:47.310
and uncomfortable moment.

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:49.320
But my life is awkward and uncomfortable.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:51.570
The camera's in front
of my face every day.

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:53.280
I've gotta do emotional things

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:55.620
that I don't normally do every moment.

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:57.930
And I have to get somehow
comfortable with it

00:00:57.930 --> 00:00:59.700
and have it be all right.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:03.060
And so the best way to be
calm, (breathes in heavily)

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:04.863
my yoga practice helped me with-

00:01:05.697 --> 00:01:07.080
- Breathing is so important.
- "Breaking Bad."

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:08.520
Breathing really helped.

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:11.760
You know, how do I exude
being powerful, being calm,

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:13.579
being relaxed?

00:01:13.579 --> 00:01:15.600
I breathe and it helps me a great deal,

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:16.860
and I make eye contact.

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:19.410
- I love eye contact. I
love connecting with people.

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:21.360
I love showing all my faults.

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:22.920
And I love all of it

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:25.350
'cause I think that we can learn
and we all have those like,

00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:26.790
so like, you know what I'm saying?

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:29.010
Like, we all aren't perfect,

00:01:29.010 --> 00:01:31.353
so I think it's great to share that.

